IMAPAccount outlook
Host outlook.office365.com
User nishantullal@outlook.com
PassCmd "/usr/share/neomutt/oauth2/mutt_oauth2.py --provider microsoft --email nishantullal@outlook.com --format token ~/.config/neomutt/tokens/nishant_outlook.gpg"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs XOAUTH2

IMAPStore outlook-remote
Account outlook

MaildirStore outlook-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/outlook/
Inbox ~/Mail/outlook/INBOX/

Channel outlook-sync
Far :outlook-remote:
Near :outlook-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
